{
    "chapter_num": 12,
    "verses_count": 29,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Race of Faith"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore we also, since we are surrounded by so great a cloud of witnesses, let us lay aside every weight, and the sin which so easily ensnares "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "us,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and let us run with endurance the race that is set before us, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "looking unto Jesus, the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "originator"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "author and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "perfecter"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "finisher of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "our"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " faith, who for the joy that was set before Him endured the cross, despising the shame, and has sat down at the right hand of the throne of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Discipline of God"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For consider Him who endured such hostility from sinners against Himself, lest you become weary and discouraged in your souls. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You have not yet resisted to bloodshed, striving against sin. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And you have forgotten the exhortation which speaks to you as to sons:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“My son, do not despise the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "discipline"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "chastening of the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": ","
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Nor be discouraged when you are rebuked by Him;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "For"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "whom the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "loves He chastens,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And scourges every son whom He receives.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M It is for discipline that you endure; God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you endure chastening, God deals with you as with sons; for what son is there whom a father does not chasten? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if you are without chastening, of which all have become partakers, then you are illegitimate and not sons. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Furthermore, we have had human fathers who corrected "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "us,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and we paid "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " respect. Shall we not much more readily be in subjection to the Father of spirits and live? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For they indeed for a few days chastened "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "us"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as seemed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "best"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to them, but He for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "our"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " profit, that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "we"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " may be partakers of His holiness. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now no "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "discipline"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "chastening seems to be joyful for the present, but painful; nevertheless, afterward it yields the peaceable fruit of righteousness to those who have been trained by it."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Renew Your Spiritual Vitality"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore strengthen the hands which hang down, and the feeble knees, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and make straight paths for your feet, so that what is lame may not be dislocated, but rather be healed."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pursue peace with all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "people,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and holiness, without which no one will see the Lord: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "looking carefully lest anyone fall short of the grace of God; lest any root of bitterness springing up cause trouble, and by this many become defiled; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "lest there "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " any fornicator or "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "godless"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "profane person like Esau, who for one morsel of food sold his birthright. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you know that afterward, when he wanted to inherit the blessing, he was rejected, for he found no place for repentance, though he sought it diligently with tears."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Glorious Company"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you have not come "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU to that which"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to the mountain that may be touched and that burned with fire, and to blackness and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU gloom"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "darkness and tempest, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and the sound of a trumpet and the voice of words, so that those who heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " begged that the word should not be spoken to them anymore. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "(For they could not endure what was commanded: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“And if so much as a beast touches the mountain, it shall be stoned"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit the rest of v. 20."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "or shot with an arrow.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And so terrifying was the sight "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Moses said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“I am exceedingly afraid"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and trembling.”)"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But you have come to Mount Zion and to the city of the living God, the heavenly Jerusalem, to an innumerable company of angels, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "festal gathering"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "general assembly and church of the firstborn "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " registered in heaven, to God the Judge of all, to the spirits of just men made perfect, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to Jesus the Mediator of the new covenant, and to the blood of sprinkling that speaks better things than "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Abel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Hear the Heavenly Voice"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "See that you do not refuse Him who speaks. For if they did not escape who refused Him who spoke on earth, much more "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall we not escape"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " if we turn away from Him who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "speaks"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from heaven, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "whose voice then shook the earth; but now He has promised, saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Yet once more I"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU will shake"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "shake not only the earth, but also heaven.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now this, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Yet once more,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " indicates the removal of those things that are being shaken, as of things that are made, that the things which cannot be shaken may remain."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, since we are receiving a kingdom which cannot be shaken, let us have grace, by which we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M omits may"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "may serve God acceptably with reverence and godly fear. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For our God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a consuming fire."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}